pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  讲解建议：不回避问题。三处险滩按“读数—成因—治理”讲：华东续约缺口（78% vs 警戒线 85%）、获客成本上涨（CAC 1.9 万，+32%）、项目制支流收窄（占比 -4pct）。强调均有明确根因与对策，按季度复测，Q2 末半年度复判。
elements:
  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 400, 18]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 远川 2025 · 水文年报

  - elementId: meta-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 40, 300, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 10
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 里程 K4 / K7

  - elementId: station-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 62, 600, 46]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$primary;">K4</span>　险滩勘测</p>

  - elementId: conclusion
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 116, 840, 24]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 三处险滩均已探明成因、备好治理方案；按季度复测，Q2 末进行半年度复判。

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 152, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  # —— 险滩壹 ——
  - elementId: i1-mark
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 166, 80, 92]
    content:
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.2
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:10px; color:$accent3; font-family:LXGW Neo XiHei; "><strong>险滩</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:40px; color:$accent3; font-family:Source Han Serif CN;"><strong>壹</strong></span></p>

  - elementId: i1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 168, 500, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 17
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 华东河段续约缺口

  - elementId: i1-reading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 168, 260, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$accent3"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 78% vs 警戒线 85%

  - elementId: i1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 200, 750, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>成因</strong>　交付资源错配，客户成功覆盖率仅 42%；续约风险集中在年合同额 50 万元以下客户。</p>
        <p><strong>治理</strong>　客户成功团队 3→8 人；6 月底前完成 Top 40 客户健康度复盘，Q2 续约率目标 82%。</p>

  - elementId: i-rule-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 268, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  # —— 险滩贰 ——
  - elementId: i2-mark
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 278, 80, 92]
    content:
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.2
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:10px; color:$accent3; font-family:LXGW Neo XiHei;"><strong>险滩</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:40px; color:$accent3; font-family:Source Han Serif CN;"><strong>贰</strong></span></p>

  - elementId: i2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 280, 500, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 17
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 上游来水变贵：获客成本持续上涨

  - elementId: i2-reading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 280, 260, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$accent3"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: CAC 1.9万 · +32%

  - elementId: i2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 312, 750, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>成因</strong>　线索质量下降，付费渠道贡献过度集中于单一来源，自然线索占比持续走低。</p>
        <p><strong>治理</strong>　重建内容获客与伙伴转介绍体系；Q2 单客户 CAC ≤1.6 万，付费渠道占比压至 60% 以下。</p>

  - elementId: i-rule-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 380, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  # —— 险滩叁 ——
  - elementId: i3-mark
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 390, 80, 92]
    content:
