      lineHeight: 1.2
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:10px; color:$accent3; font-family:LXGW Neo XiHei;"><strong>险滩</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:40px; color:$accent3; font-family:Source Han Serif CN;"><strong>叁</strong></span></p>

  - elementId: i3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 392, 500, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 17
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 项目制支流收窄，短期流量缺口

  - elementId: i3-reading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 392, 260, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$accent3"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 占比 27% · -4pct

  - elementId: i3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 424, 750, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>成因</strong>　低毛利项目制收入主动收缩，叠加大客户交付周期拉长，形成短期流量缺口。</p>
        <p><strong>治理</strong>　以订阅产品承接溢出需求；项目制聚焦战略客户，毛利优先于规模，缺口由干流增量对冲。</p>

